Design-time preview text moved to the tools namespace
52 hardcoded captions and 9 content descriptions now use string resources
Partition ids and size presets marked non-translatable; locale keys aligned</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v115_title">v1.1.5 - Structure Dedup &amp; Language-Neutral Failure Details</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v115_desc">Merged duplicated theme bootstrap, dp conversion, breadcrumb bar and failure dialog code into shared implementations\nAll settings reads and writes now go through SettingsStore instead of raw SharedPreferences\nRemoved 13 unreferenced drawables and eliminated every remaining cross-file duplicate block\n19 low-level failure details now carry only the failing command and raw output, keeping them neutral across all three locales\nCI now fails fast on blank signing secrets, restored the keystore decode step and refreshed deprecated actions</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v114_title">v1.1.4 - Pipe Deadlock Fixes &amp; UI Copy Cleanup</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v114_desc">Fixed pipe deadlock that silently dropped su output beyond 64KiB\nUnmount residue now matches exactly and verifies truthfully instead of reporting false success\nAdded 24 lifecycle guards across the main and explorer screens to stop crashes on back or theme switch\nCached settings and device info reads, cutting root forks on startup and save from 8 down to 1\nLog panel now appends incrementally past 500 entries instead of rebuilding the entire list each time\nTrimmed 42 UI strings, removing redundant modifiers from titles</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v113_title">v1.1.3 - Daemon Process and Caller Authentication</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v113_desc">Gh0stOverlayService moved to its own daemon process (:daemon); survives task swipe\nAndroid 14+ foreground service with low-priority silent notification and START_STICKY restart\nSignature-level permission plus runtime UID check against unauthorized callers\nCompanion-app IPC; rebuilt release signing and CI/CD</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v112_title">v1.1.2 - Dynamic Device Info</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v112_desc">Removed hardcoded device strings; DeviceInfoHelper probes at runtime\nDetects OEM marketing names (vivo/iQOO, Xiaomi/Redmi, OPPO/OnePlus, Honor)\nReads Linux device codename and Android version\nDevice chip is tap-to-copy for hardware and ABI info\nUnified header subtitle and init logs</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v111_title">v1.1.1 - AIDL IPC Service Integration</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v111_desc">Added IGh0stOverlayService AIDL inter-process communication interface\nExposed public Service (OVERLAY_SERVICE) for external modules/apps to interface with manager\nSupports remote Root probing, partition status query, upperdir retrieval, mount &amp; unmount\nSupports remote storage sync (syncStorage) and soft reboot (restartZygote)</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v110_title">v1.1.0 - About Page and Navigation Reorder</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v110_desc">Replaced payloads tab with an About page\nReordered bottom nav: Control, Partitions, Logs, Settings, About\nHeader shows logo and build-time git hash\nAdded open-source &amp; free notice and GitHub link\nAdded changelog timeline, localized</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v103_title">v1.0.3 - Multi-Root and Legacy Kernel Support</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v103_desc">Added KernelSU, Magisk, APatch, and absolute su path auto-detection\nStep-based loop allocation for legacy kernels (Linux 4.14), fixing attach conflicts\nSELinux contexts synced on mount, fixing permission denied (error=13)\nMount without image now prompts for creation instead of building one implicitly</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v102_title">v1.0.2 - Loop Release and Idempotent Mount</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v102_desc">Release loop devices on unmount\nScan free loop slots (30..99) to avoid EBUSY\nRemoved auto-resize; minimum image size lowered to 16 MiB</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v101_title">v1.0.1 - Concurrent Mount and Debounce</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v101_desc">Concurrent multi-partition mounting\nUI debounce and refresh guards\nGitHub Actions CI/CD</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v100_title">v1.0.0 - Initial Open Source Release</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_v100_desc">First official open-source release\nModify system partitions without reflashing via OverlayFS\nLiquid glass bottom bar and Material You theming</string>

